    {"id":"STR-07/E3","segment_id":"STR-07","ordinal":3,"role":"user","event_type":"pull_request_body","source":{"source_id":"gh:pr:1010","kind":"pull_request","repository":"Kludex/starlette","number":1010,"database_id":"456633530","node_id":"MDExOlB1bGxSZXF1ZXN0NDU2NjMzNTMw","url":"https://github.com/Kludex/starlette/pull/1010","commit_sha":"503e95931b3be47fb606069698cc1d6558c91f33"},"occurred_at":"2020-07-25T16:11:00Z","source_updated_at":"2020-10-27T14:43:28Z","actor":"JulienRobitaille","summary":"PR 1010 opens from an existing initial commit that special-cases a final question mark and adds routing tests for both slash variants; current body text is only a change detector.","source_content_sha256":"4608ca940e215aa4ef9e77edda7569dfaa9995b50736314ee5ffb625da83be62"},
    {"id":"STR-07/E4","segment_id":"STR-07","ordinal":4,"role":"user","event_type":"pull_request_comment","source":{"source_id":"gh:pr-comment:664182957","kind":"pull_request_comment","repository":"Kludex/starlette","number":1010,"database_id":"664182957","node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY2NDE4Mjk1Nw==","url":"https://github.com/Kludex/starlette/pull/1010#issuecomment-664182957","commit_sha":null},"occurred_at":"2020-07-27T07:55:26Z","source_updated_at":"2020-07-27T07:55:26Z","actor":"lovelydinosaur","summary":"A maintainer rejects optional trailing-slash regex as the desired contract and recommends one canonical route form plus Starlette's redirect behavior.","source_content_sha256":"d0ddd7f93f544af2e6e2f70e4d850e939e1eac9b85535aad04526045625e221a"},
    {"id":"STR-07/E5","segment_id":"STR-07","ordinal":5,"role":"user","event_type":"issue_comment","source":{"source_id":"gh:issue-comment:664573918","kind":"issue_comment","repository":"Kludex/starlette","number":1008,"database_id":"664573918","node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY2NDU3MzkxOA==","url":"https://github.com/Kludex/starlette/issues/1008#issuecomment-664573918","commit_sha":null},"occurred_at":"2020-07-27T18:48:24Z","source_updated_at":"2020-07-27T18:48:24Z","actor":"tarioch","summary":"Another user reports that /.* also stopped matching, broadening the affected reliance from an optional root slash to a wildcard SPA route.","source_content_sha256":"5197f96143655c0a947a04c666ecdbfe498c3336770f9ea96ac4c04c81af852e"},
    {"id":"STR-07/E6","segment_id":"STR-07","ordinal":6,"role":"user","event_type":"issue_comment","source":{"source_id":"gh:issue-comment:664875431","kind":"issue_comment","repository":"Kludex/starlette","number":1008,"database_id":"664875431","node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY2NDg3NTQzMQ==","url":"https://github.com/Kludex/starlette/issues/1008#issuecomment-664875431","commit_sha":null},"occurred_at":"2020-07-28T08:46:28Z","source_updated_at":"2020-07-28T08:46:28Z","actor":"lovelydinosaur","summary":"The maintainer states that Route and Mount paths support URI templating rather than general regex, recommends a path converter for wildcard segments, and retains redirects for slash variants.","source_content_sha256":"f6292e5371f3501bf236beb345629a66e58b370c9d6a39f4b62c5fdbd0212f05"},
    {"id":"STR-07/E7","segment_id":"STR-07","ordinal":7,"role":"user","event_type":"issue_comment","source":{"source_id":"gh:issue-comment:664972962","kind":"issue_comment","repository":"Kludex/starlette","number":1008,"database_id":"664972962","node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY2NDk3Mjk2Mg==","url":"https://github.com/Kludex/starlette/issues/1008#issuecomment-664972962","commit_sha":null},"occurred_at":"2020-07-28T10:55:54Z","source_updated_at":"2020-07-28T10:55:54Z","actor":"curtiscook","summary":"The reporter explains that a 307 redirect is not equivalent for the root use case because it can drop CORS headers, and argues that the behavioral break needs clearer versioning and documentation.","source_content_sha256":"f859bc3bda00bf79338bef6889be6f93f2debe2c43bf8485434761a10926ca6b"},
    {"id":"STR-07/E8","segment_id":"STR-07","ordinal":8,"role":"user","event_type":"issue_comment","source":{"source_id":"gh:issue-comment:664992297","kind":"issue_comment","repository":"Kludex/starlette","number":1008,"database_id":"664992297","node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY2NDk5MjI5Nw==","url":"https://github.com/Kludex/starlette/issues/1008#issuecomment-664992297","commit_sha":null},"occurred_at":"2020-07-28T11:44:32Z","source_updated_at":"2020-07-28T11:44:32Z","actor":"lovelydinosaur","summary":"The maintainer says reverting and later reapplying the change with a larger release and documentation is worth considering, reopening that release decision without committing to it.","source_content_sha256":"d26bb48af5327eda9df73f07db03300289eb1b5707db6b700026977fa129d850"},
